  <!--EN: Bard Training-->
  <TM_BardTraining.label>吟游诗人训练</TM_BardTraining.label>
  <!--原中文: '通过进行表演, 喜剧, 社交和鼓舞来磨砺吟游诗人的能力。\n  \n等级：\n见习吟游诗人：社交+10%，谈判+20%，贸易+10%，\n疼痛阈值-10%，负重-10，工作速度-10%\n\n初阶吟游诗人：社交+20%，谈判+30%，贸易+15%，\n疼痛阈值-12%，负重-15，工作速度-12%\n\n高阶吟游诗人：社交+30%，谈判+35%，贸易+20%，\n疼痛阈值-14%，负重-18，工作速度-14%\n\n传奇吟游诗人：社交+35%，谈判+40%，贸易+25%，\n疼痛阈值-15%，负重-20，工作速度-15%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Hone the skills of a bard by undergoing training in performing arts, comedy, socializing, and inspiration. Each level will change the bard's trait to reflect their skill level.
	
Ranks:
Entertainer: Social impact +10%, Negotiation +20%, Trade +10%,
Pain threshold -10%, carrying capacity -10, work speed -10%

Performer: Social impact +20%, Negotiation +30%, Trade +15%,
Pain threshold -12%, carrying capacity -15, work speed -12%

Minstrel: Social impact +30%, Negotiation +35%, Trade +20%,
Pain threshold -14%, carrying capacity -18, work speed -14%

Bard: Social impact +35%, Negotiation +40%, Trade +25%,
Pain threshold -15%, carrying capacity -20, work speed -15%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Hone the skills of a bard by undergoing training in performing arts, comedy, socializing, and inspiration. Each level will change the bard's trait to reflect their skill level.
	
Ranks:
Entertainer: Social impact +10%, Negotiation +20%, Trade +10%,
Pain threshold -10%, carrying capacity -10, work speed -10%

Performer: Social impact +20%, Negotiation +30%, Trade +15%,
Pain threshold -12%, carrying capacity -15, work speed -12%

Minstrel: Social impact +30%, Negotiation +35%, Trade +20%,
Pain threshold -14%, carrying capacity -18, work speed -14%

Bard: Social impact +35%, Negotiation +40%, Trade +25%,
Pain threshold -15%, carrying capacity -20, work speed -15%-->
  <TM_BardTraining.description>通过进行表演, 喜剧, 社交和鼓舞来磨砺吟游诗人的能力。\n  \n等级：\n见习吟游诗人：社交+10%，谈判+20%，贸易+10%，\n疼痛阈值-10%，负重-10，工作速度-10%\n\n初阶吟游诗人：社交+20%，谈判+30%，贸易+15%，\n疼痛阈值-12%，负重-15，工作速度-12%\n\n高阶吟游诗人：社交+30%，谈判+35%，贸易+20%，\n疼痛阈值-14%，负重-18，工作速度-14%\n\n传奇吟游诗人：社交+35%，谈判+40%，贸易+25%，\n疼痛阈值-15%，负重-20，工作速度-15%</TM_BardTraining.description>
  <!-- Entertain -->
  <!--原中文: '娱乐', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Entertain',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Entertain-->
  <TM_Entertain.label>娱乐</TM_Entertain.label>
  <!--原中文: '使用各种方法娱乐周围的朋友。该技能由一个被动技能和一个主动技能组成。被动技能允许吟游诗人在交谈中娱乐其他的殖民者。\n\n该指令可以控制技能开启或关闭.\n	\n激活此能力后会覆盖整个殖民地并且允许吟游诗人发掘到处于烦恼中的殖民者并试图让他们感到快乐. 当招待成功时吟游诗人会如何法师一般获得经验点数。保持开启此能力会降低30点最大法力值。吟游诗人的演奏作为一种工作类型存在，因此会根据"监管"工作的优先级来进行招待。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Entertain fellow colonists using a variety of methods. This skill has two components, a passive skill and an active skill. The passive skill allows the bard to entertain other colonists in passing conversation.

This command toggles the active skill on or off.
	
Activating the ability casts a net over the colony and allows the bard to detect troubled pawns and attempt to entertain them. The bard will gain experience points as a mage when active entertaining is successful. Keeping this ability active reduces max mana by 30. The bard performs entertainment as a type of job, and will perform entertainment based on the priority of the "Warden" work type.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Entertain fellow colonists using a variety of methods. This skill has two components, a passive skill and an active skill. The passive skill allows the bard to entertain other colonists in passing conversation.

This command toggles the active skill on or off.
	
Activating the ability casts a net over the colony and allows the bard to detect troubled pawns and attempt to entertain them. The bard will gain experience points as a mage when active entertaining is successful. Keeping this ability active reduces max mana by 30. The bard performs entertainment as a type of job, and will perform entertainment based on the priority of the "Warden" work type.-->
  <TM_Entertain.description>使用各种方法娱乐周围的朋友。该技能由一个被动技能和一个主动技能组成。被动技能允许吟游诗人在交谈中娱乐其他的殖民者。\n\n该指令可以控制技能开启或关闭.\n	\n激活此能力后会覆盖整个殖民地并且允许吟游诗人发掘到处于烦恼中的殖民者并试图让他们感到快乐. 当招待成功时吟游诗人会如何法师一般获得经验点数。保持开启此能力会降低30点最大法力值。吟游诗人的演奏作为一种工作类型存在，因此会根据"监管"工作的优先级来进行招待。</TM_Entertain.description>
