  <TM_BattleHymn.label>战斗之曲</TM_BattleHymn.label>
  <!--原中文: '演奏一曲图森破来鼓舞周围的友军。每一篇诗歌都会进一步加强友军的战斗能力。每一篇诗歌额外消耗9的法力 (通过训练可降低)。通过使用技能来控制开启或关闭。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Play a rousing battle hymn to motivate and empower nearby allies. Each verse of the hymn adds to the effect and will further bolster the combat power of allies. Every verse consumes 9% additional mana (reduced through training). 
	
Battle Hymn has a small chance to cause inspirations that will further boost combat abilities. 
	
Use the skill to activate or deactivate the ability.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Play a rousing battle hymn to motivate and empower nearby allies. Each verse of the hymn adds to the effect and will further bolster the combat power of allies. Every verse consumes 9% additional mana (reduced through training). 
	
Battle Hymn has a small chance to cause inspirations that will further boost combat abilities. 
	
Use the skill to activate or deactivate the ability.-->
  <TM_BattleHymn.description>演奏一曲图森破来鼓舞周围的友军。每一篇诗歌都会进一步加强友军的战斗能力。每一篇诗歌额外消耗9的法力 (通过训练可降低)。通过使用技能来控制开启或关闭。</TM_BattleHymn.description>
